	"FriendlyName": "CoPresence Annotate",
	"Description": "Lets people draw on their editor to point the agents at things. A shortcut turns the editor into a sketch layer; each mark goes to the agents with what it covers, in the level or in the editor's panels, and a picture of the editor as the person saw it. It also shows a voice call's live captions along the bottom of the level viewport.",
